CORE
deep-operand-chain.smt2

^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^sat$
--
^\(error
--
Regression test for the iterative SMT2 expression parser. A deeply right-
associated operand chain `(bvand x (bvand x (bvand x ... x)))` of depth 5000
is parsed and solved without overflowing the default 8 MB C++ stack. The
recursive operand-collection path segfaults on the same input.
